                                                "sense_id": "1bfd8ec8-b95e-3014-80e1-8d6847f407d9",
                                                "text": "slow the traffic"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f9035e1-b1c5-328c-a080-0f2ee8b2564f",
                                        "entry_id": "c516f95d-fc41-3da7-b456-5ddfb1430ae4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become slow; to slacken in speed; to decelerate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49c4f22b-ef5e-4502-bf80-7319bb4ea045",
                                                "sense_id": "2f9035e1-b1c5-328c-a080-0f2ee8b2564f",
                                                "text": "After about a minute, the creek bed vomited the debris into a gently sloped meadow. Saugstad felt the snow slow and tried to keep her hands in front of her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "259ff240-ae79-42a5-8a02-934290664ea5",
                                                "sense_id": "2f9035e1-b1c5-328c-a080-0f2ee8b2564f",
                                                "text": "As he passed though the station, he slowed to yell to the signalman, Frank 'Sailor' Bridges: \"Sailor - have you anything between here and Fordham? Where's the mail?\" Gimbert knew the mail train was due, and he didn't want to endanger another train with his burning bomb wagon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
